{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model with multiprofile setting, using pca_n2000 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6186 suggests multiprofile may improve performance compared to singleprofile baselines (e.g., 0.5266 accuracy in llm_summary_001), though the role of avgpool aggregation and fusion method effectiveness remains uncertain without direct comparison to other aggregation strategies or fusion variants."
